    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a game i can just learn the rules to though. it's like i'm built different. every single day is just... manual labor. trying to talk, trying to look right, trying to understand why people find things so easy. i'm just so incredibly tired of existing like this. i feel like i'm running on empty and there's no way to refill it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
